  "meta": {
    "source": "quicksheet-original",
    "note": "Original QuickSheet tables for two story aspects shown on every sheet. High concept: a short phrase that sums up who the character is and what they do. Trouble: something that keeps complicating their life, either a personal struggle or a problem relationship. Story prompts only, with no mechanical effect in Daggerheart. Roles are keyed by class; nothing is keyed to ancestry. Tokens: {role}, {descriptor}, {sideline}, {circle}, {familyTie}, {family} (the character's family name)."
